{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20165","headline":"和钱侍郎甘露 · 孟郊","name":"和钱侍郎甘露","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玄天何以言，瑞露青松繁。\n忽见垂书迹，还惊涌澧源。\n春枝晨嫋嫋，香味晓翻翻。\n子礼忽来献，臣心固易敦。\n清风惜不动，薄雾肯蒙昏。\n嘉昼色更晶，仁慈久乃存。\n一方难独占，天下恐争论。\n侧听飞中使，重荣华德门。\n从公乐万寿，余庆及儿孙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20165.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20165","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}